declaration injections_for_8_234567 content list of Injection
  depends on injections content list of Injection, pred content integer,
             wanted_2 content integer, wanted_3 content integer, wanted_4 content integer, wanted_5 content integer, wanted_6 content integer, wanted_7 content integer
  equals
