declaration pred_s152_c_2_4 content integer equals 18

declaration pred_s152_c_3_3 content integer equals 19

declaration pred_s152_d_2_H_6 content integer equals 91

declaration pred_s2_a_3 content integer equals 31

declaration pred_s2_a_5 content integer equals 32

declaration pred_s2_b_3 content integer equals 30

declaration pred_s3306_a_2 content integer equals 92

declaration pred_s3306_b_8 content integer equals 96

declaration pred_s3306_c_5 content integer equals 97

declaration pred_s63_3 content integer equals 28

declaration pred_s63_c_3 content integer equals 201

